          <p>Endemic species evolution and conservation on Mediterranean islands</p>
        </div>
        <div class="interest-card">
          <span class="interest-icon">💧</span>
          <h4>Wetland Conservation</h4>
          <p>Biodiversity monitoring and ecosystem health in North African wetlands</p>
        </div>
        <div class="interest-card">
          <span class="interest-icon">📊</span>
          <h4>Statistical Modeling</h4>
          <p>Species distribution modeling and ecological data analysis</p>
        </div>
        <div class="interest-card">
          <span class="interest-icon">🌍</span>
          <h4>Conservation Planning</h4>
          <p>Monitoring & evaluation frameworks for conservation programs</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
